---
title: Pizza Sauce
description: All-purpose pizza sauce with anchovy, garlic, and San Marzano tomatoes — “hide the little fish.”
source: https://foodwishes.blogspot.com/2012/02/pizza-sauce-lets-play-hide-little-fish.html
author: Chef John (Food Wishes)
servings: 1
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 40 minutes
time required: 55 minutes
course: sauce
cuisine: Italian-American
tags:
  - pizza
